    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "survival? survival of what? just salt and dust? i feel like i'm just a ghost wandering through a graveyard. it's not just the kingdom, Elara... it's like my soul actually died when the fires went out. every breath just feels like a chore I don't want to do anymore. there's no \"salvaging\" a person who is already gone.",
